<title>NETHERLANDS: Delta ups Nutricia to a buy.</title>
<headline>Delta ups Nutricia to a buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of April 9 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Nutricia	  Food	    286.90  Delta Lloyd Bank.</p>
<p>COMMENT: &quot;Although the share trades at a high PE multiple we believe that Nutricia's ability to capitalise on its food knowledge results in a favourable earnings outlook, which more than justifies this multiple. We therefore upgrade the stock to a buy (from a hold).&quot;</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		  9.58    29.6   21.4   3.20</p>
<p>    1997		  11.80   24.0   18.3   3.70</p>
<p>    1998		  13.32   21.3   16.7   4.30</p>
